00:28:36.770 --> 00:28:39.410
And it turns out all of his stuff fell into the toilet.

650
00:28:39.430 --> 00:28:39.690
Toilet.

651
00:28:39.930 --> 00:28:41.830
And then a couple things he threw in anger.

652
00:28:42.330 --> 00:28:43.690
That's my favorite part.

653
00:28:44.870 --> 00:28:46.230
So I'm like, oh, okay.

654
00:28:46.710 --> 00:28:48.910
I mean I remember this cold open.

655
00:28:49.430 --> 00:28:51.750
But I'm looking, did we put it on another episode?

656
00:28:51.930 --> 00:28:52.550
It's like, no.

657
00:28:52.650 --> 00:28:53.170
I'm like, okay.

658
00:28:53.170 --> 00:28:55.390
It's not on the DVDs deleted scenes.

659
00:28:55.430 --> 00:28:56.830
So we must have saved it.

660
00:28:57.110 --> 00:29:02.090
But what happened was is that by the time we started season five, everything had changed.

661
00:29:02.330 --> 00:29:03.530
I'm turning the pages again.

662
00:29:03.910 --> 00:29:07.530
Yeah, because Toby was gone and Holly came in.

663
00:29:07.530 --> 00:29:09.190
So it was like a whole new thing going on.

664
00:29:09.410 --> 00:29:11.170
So it just was loSt.

665
00:29:11.490 --> 00:29:11.630
Yeah.

