00:29:11.710 --> 00:29:15.890
You couldn't plug it in an episode now because there would be the wrong people in the background.

667
00:29:16.990 --> 00:29:18.130
So that was the thing.

668
00:29:18.250 --> 00:29:20.450
So I'm looking like, wait, did we not put this anywhere?

669
00:29:20.450 --> 00:29:23.510
So I go to search on Google for this.

670
00:29:23.650 --> 00:29:25.630
An article comes up from you guys.

671
00:29:25.790 --> 00:29:26.750
From Office Ladies?

