674
00:29:31.550 --> 00:29:32.430
And it was this.

675
00:29:32.550 --> 00:29:38.310
And in reading that, you had a comment though about something where it was, oh, I love this

676
00:29:38.310 --> 00:29:42.010
thing where he throws his keys in anger or something like that.

677
00:29:42.130 --> 00:29:44.330
Literally, there was an extra thing.

678
00:29:44.840 --> 00:29:46.650
And that wasn't in the assembly version.

679
00:29:46.710 --> 00:29:48.030
And I put that in.

680
00:29:48.970 --> 00:29:51.230
Oh, that was my favorite part.

681
00:29:51.430 --> 00:29:51.610
Yeah.

682
00:29:51.850 --> 00:29:55.230
I mean, when I went through to do a polish and it turns out we had so much stuff.

683
00:29:55.310 --> 00:29:57.190
We found that in the script.

684
00:29:57.390 --> 00:29:57.770
Yes.

685
00:29:57.990 --> 00:30:00.090
And we reached out to Jean and Lee about it.

686
00:30:00.310 --> 00:30:02.850
Again, I was looking to see, you know, is this anywhere?

687
00:30:03.110 --> 00:30:05.570
I'm checking all these episodes towards the end of season four.

688
00:30:05.690 --> 00:30:07.390
And then I'm looking at the beginning of season five.

689
00:30:07.530 --> 00:30:08.730
And then I was like, this is weird.

690
00:30:08.850 --> 00:30:11.750
And then I Googled and then your thing came up.

691
00:30:11.750 --> 00:30:15.190
You know, there was some news story about you guys talking about the scene.

692
00:30:15.290 --> 00:30:17.990
And I think I reached out to you guys and said, hey, we have it.

693
00:30:18.090 --> 00:30:20.530
I found it, you know, and it was never a deleted scene or anything.

694
00:30:20.650 --> 00:30:21.330
So that's great.

695
00:30:21.330 --> 00:30:25.790
When you have a full, a fully fledged scene like that, that's just so funny.

696
00:30:25.910 --> 00:30:27.470
And again, I get to tweak stuff.

697
00:30:27.570 --> 00:30:32.070
So I love the shot with the tennis racket and Pam's face is behind it, you know, like

698
00:30:32.070 --> 00:30:33.490
the way that's framed.

699
00:30:33.670 --> 00:30:37.430
And there was just other things where, you know, there were other versions even of the

700
00:30:37.430 --> 00:30:37.630
scene.

701
00:30:37.750 --> 00:30:38.910
And it was like really carving.

702
00:30:39.030 --> 00:30:39.830
What's the best version?

703
00:30:39.830 --> 00:30:43.210
You know, Michael's asking everyone who wants to try, you want to try Kevin?

704
00:30:43.730 --> 00:30:48.410
And then, you know, coming back to like Creed, you know, him saying that'll make a great

705
00:30:48.410 --> 00:30:49.130
tennis racket.

