00:30:53.090 --> 00:30:57.630
It's like later, Toby goes to his desk and he pulls out his tennis racket and he swings

708
00:30:57.630 --> 00:30:59.290
it and it's all bent and broken.

709
00:30:59.510 --> 00:31:00.590
That's what Michael did.

710
00:31:00.610 --> 00:31:02.410
He used Toby's tennis racket.

711
00:31:02.410 --> 00:31:05.210
He broke it and he taped, he just taped it up.

712
00:31:05.450 --> 00:31:10.210
And Toby goes like, and he's like, hey, you know, he reacts to his broken tennis racket.

713
00:31:10.530 --> 00:31:12.270
So that was a great find.

714
00:31:12.270 --> 00:31:13.070
That's a pretty good treasure.

715
00:31:13.350 --> 00:31:13.550
Yeah.

716
00:31:13.830 --> 00:31:15.510
I can't wait now to go watch it.

717
00:31:15.670 --> 00:31:17.410
I want to see it in the super fan episode.

