736
00:31:52.690 --> 00:31:55.510
And he's trying to convince you that it's really a poignant song.

737
00:31:55.510 --> 00:32:00.470
And, you know, it's, it's very, uh, I think it's a very funny cold open.

738
00:32:00.790 --> 00:32:00.930
Yeah.

