1248
00:53:40.170 --> 00:53:40.290
Yeah.

1249
00:53:40.610 --> 00:53:41.790
Then we walk a few steps.

1250
00:53:41.830 --> 00:53:42.870
And then there's Kasha.

1251
00:53:43.110 --> 00:53:45.330
Then we see Kelly Cantley in the hallway.

1252
00:53:45.330 --> 00:53:46.890
And then there you are.

1253
00:53:47.050 --> 00:53:47.210
Yeah.

1254
00:53:47.330 --> 00:53:48.450
I mean, it just was.

1255
00:53:48.670 --> 00:53:50.070
It was so special.

1256
00:53:50.410 --> 00:53:50.590
Yeah.

1257
00:53:50.910 --> 00:53:51.170
Yeah.

1258
00:53:51.330 --> 00:53:51.710
It was.

1259
00:53:52.110 --> 00:53:54.970
It is really nice to see familiar faces.

1260
00:53:55.210 --> 00:53:55.730
I mean, Veda.

1261
00:53:56.070 --> 00:53:56.430
Yes.

1262
00:53:56.430 --> 00:53:57.530
So Arne is there.

1263
00:53:58.070 --> 00:53:58.550
Rusty.

1264
00:53:58.550 --> 00:53:59.810
Rusty Mahmood.

1265
00:53:59.910 --> 00:54:00.590
Mahmood is there.

1266
00:54:01.210 --> 00:54:03.810
So there are a lot of, you know, familiar faces.

1267
