1282
00:54:33.650 --> 00:54:43.070
Everybody was just very, you know, just they know what you guys have done and what you guys have brought to, you know, television and this universe, this office universe.

1283
00:54:43.070 --> 00:54:45.650
And, you know, it means a lot.

1284
00:54:45.710 --> 00:54:46.810
You guys are royalty.

1285
00:54:47.170 --> 00:54:47.530
Aw.

1286
00:54:47.530 --> 00:54:47.850
Really.

1287
00:54:48.210 --> 00:54:48.310
Yeah.

1288
