Maybe this year or next year I'll make sure I drink it.

1387
00:59:26.390 --> 00:59:27.530
Does anybody want to share?

1388
00:59:27.870 --> 00:59:28.830
Yeah, come over.

1389
00:59:29.230 --> 00:59:31.290
We'll come over for some Aaron Sorkin champagne.

1390
00:59:31.410 --> 00:59:33.470
Let's have some – we'll watch a super fan episode.

1391
00:59:33.570 --> 00:59:33.970
How's that?

1392
00:59:34.150 --> 00:59:34.730
Oh, yes.

1393
00:59:34.830 --> 00:59:35.470
I love that.

1394
00:59:35.730 --> 00:59:36.330
I love that.

1395
00:59:36.410 --> 00:59:36.830
All right.

1396
